.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SH "fast-glob"
.PP
.RS 4
It's a very fast and efficient \fRglob\fP library for \fRNode\&.js\fP\&. 
.RE
.PP

.PP
This package provides methods for traversing the file system and returning pathnames that matched a defined set of a specified pattern according to the rules used by the Unix Bash shell with some simplifications, meanwhile results are returned in \fBarbitrary order\fP\&. Quick, simple, effective\&.
