.SS "Helpers"
.SS "\fRgenerateTasks(patterns, [options])\fP"
Returns the internal representation of patterns (\fR\fRTask\fP\fP is a combining patterns by base directory)\&.

.PP
.PP
.nf
fg\&.generateTasks('*');

[{
    base: '\&.', // Parent directory for all patterns inside this task
    dynamic: true, // Dynamic or static patterns are in this task
    patterns: ['*'],
    positive: ['*'],
    negative: []
}]
.fi
.PP
